msgid "FLAC can use more CPU. Choose a format supported by your speaker."
msgstr "FLAC 可能占用更多 CPU。请选择音箱支持的格式。"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:54
#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:69
