#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:81
msgid ""
"Compatibility only. Change this when a UPnP speaker cannot play at all; the "
"default works for most devices."
msgstr "仅用于兼容性。当 UPnP 音箱完全无法播放时再修改此项；默认值适用于大多数设备。"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:83
msgid "-1: no content-length (default)"
msgstr "-1：无 content-length（默认）"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:84
msgid "-3: chunked encoding"
msgstr "-3：分块传输"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:85
msgid "0: fixed dummy length"
msgstr "0：固定的虚拟长度"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:93
msgid "UPnP search version (UPnP only)"
msgstr "UPnP 搜索版本（仅 UPnP）"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:94
msgid ""
"Highest UPnP MediaRenderer version to search. The Chromecast engine ignores "
"this."
msgstr "要搜索的最高 UPnP MediaRenderer 版本。Chromecast 引擎会忽略此项。"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:116
msgid "Unsaved changes"
msgstr "未保存的更改"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:131
msgid "General settings"
msgstr "常规设置"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:133
msgid "Enable AirConnect"
msgstr "启用 AirConnect"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:133
msgid ""
"Changes take effect after Save & Apply. Applying briefly disconnects AirPlay."
msgstr "保存并应用后更改才会生效。应用配置时 AirPlay 会短暂断开。"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:135
msgid "LAN interface"
msgstr "局域网接口"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:135
msgid "Bind discovery and AirPlay to your local network interface."
msgstr "将发现和 AirPlay 绑定到本地网络接口。"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:138
msgid "UPnP / DLNA speakers"
msgstr "UPnP / DLNA 音箱"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:139
msgid "Chromecast speakers"
msgstr "Chromecast 音箱"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:140
msgid "UPnP volume limit"
msgstr "UPnP 音量上限"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:140
msgid "Default maximum volume, from 1 to 100."
msgstr "默认最大音量，范围为 1 到 100。"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:142
msgid "Chromecast media volume"
msgstr "Chromecast 媒体音量"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:142
msgid "Default media volume, from 0 to 1. This is not a volume limit."
msgstr "默认媒体音量，范围为 0 到 1。这不是音量上限。"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:147
#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:183
msgid "Buffer and latency"
msgstr "缓冲与延迟"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:147
msgid "Format: 1000:2000. Lower values may cause audio dropouts."
msgstr "格式：1000:2000。数值过低可能导致音频断续。"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:150
#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:187
msgid "Send track information"
msgstr "发送曲目信息"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:150
msgid ""
"Sends the title and artist to the speaker. Both engines read this. A speaker "
"may still show nothing."
msgstr "将标题和艺术家发送给音箱。两个引擎都会读取此项，但音箱仍可能不显示。"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:151
#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:188
msgid "Cover art URL"
msgstr "封面图片 URL"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:151
msgid ""
"Optional http:// or https:// image the speaker fetches itself. Leave empty "
"for none. The router never downloads it."
msgstr "可选的 http:// 或 https:// 图片地址，由音箱自行获取。留空表示不使用。路由器不会下载图片。"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:153
#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:190
msgid "Handle FLUSH"
msgstr "处理 FLUSH"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:153
msgid ""
"Compatibility option, both engines. Turning it off can change pause and "
"track-change behaviour, so keep it on unless a speaker misbehaves."
msgstr "两个引擎都适用的兼容性选项。关闭后可能改变暂停和切歌行为，除非音箱表现异常，否则请保持开启。"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:154
#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:191
msgid "Let the timing reference drift"
msgstr "允许时序参考漂移"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:154
msgid ""
"Both engines. Off adjusts timing by adding or dropping a frame, which can be "
"audible as a click; on avoids the click but risks underruns."
msgstr "两个引擎都适用。关闭时通过增加或丢弃帧来调整时序，可能听到咔嗒声；开启可避免咔嗒声，但可能发生欠载。"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:158
msgid "Stop the receiver (Chromecast only)"
msgstr "停止接收器（仅 Chromecast）"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:158
msgid "Chromecast compatibility option. The UPnP engine ignores this."
msgstr "Chromecast 兼容性选项。UPnP 引擎会忽略此项。"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:159
msgid "Log detail"
msgstr "日志详细程度"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:164
msgid "Advanced settings"
msgstr "高级设置"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:170
msgid "Enable bridging"
msgstr "启用桥接"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:171
msgid "AirPlay name"
msgstr "AirPlay 名称"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:171
msgid ""
"Changes only the virtual AirPlay receiver name. Leave empty to use the "
"original name."
msgstr "只修改虚拟 AirPlay 接收器名称。留空则使用原名称。"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:172
#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:317
msgid "Original name"
msgstr "原名称"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:174
msgid "Volume limit"
msgstr "音量上限"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:174
msgid "Leave empty to inherit the global UPnP limit."
msgstr "留空以继承全局 UPnP 音量上限。"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:177
msgid "Media volume"
msgstr "媒体音量"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:177
msgid "Leave empty to inherit the global Chromecast volume."
msgstr "留空以继承全局 Chromecast 音量。"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:183
#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:187
#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:188
#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:190
#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:191
#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:196
msgid "Leave empty to inherit the global setting."
msgstr "留空以继承全局设置。"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:189
msgid "No cover art"
msgstr "无封面图片"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:196
msgid "Stop the receiver"
msgstr "停止接收器"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:203
msgid "Advanced audio settings"
msgstr "高级音频设置"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:266
msgid "More than one speaker uses the same AirPlay name."
msgstr "多个音箱使用了相同的 AirPlay 名称。"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:268
msgid ""
"AirPlay lists these receivers under one name. Give each speaker its own name."
msgstr "AirPlay 会将这些接收器显示为同一个名称。请为每个音箱设置独立名称。"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:280
msgid "Device information"
msgstr "设备信息"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:294
