msgstr "上次尝试："

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:343
msgid ""
"Unknown — no completed mDNS observation. This needs the engine running and "
"its receiver advertised on this LAN."
msgstr "未知 — 没有完成的 mDNS 观测。这需要引擎运行，并在此局域网中广播接收器。"

#: packages/luci-app-airconnect-manager/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/airconnect-manager/overview.js:351
